  "notes": [
    "**Sacar** is a regular **-AR verb** with a spelling change",
    "Spelling change: c→qu before é (saqué, not \"sacé\") - same pattern as explicar",
    "This spelling change only affects the \"yo\" form in preterite",
    "Multiple meanings: to take out, to get, to remove, to obtain, to get (grades)",
    "Common usage: *sacar la basura* (to take out the trash), *sacar fotos* (to take photos), *sacar buenas notas* (to get good grades), *sacar dinero* (to withdraw money)",
    "Many idiomatic expressions: *sacar a bailar* (to ask to dance), *sacar de quicio* (to drive crazy)"
  ],
